WEBVTT

00:12.840 --> 00:14.610
Just a little more, Esra!

00:16.290 --> 00:18.870
The head is out! It’ll be born soon!

00:37.210 --> 00:38.860
How interesting.

00:38.860 --> 00:44.770
Never in a thousand years did I imagine it was possible for a human to be born with this kind of power.

00:45.110 --> 00:47.270
It's truly... a miracle.

00:52.430 --> 00:55.280
A miraculous child wielding power.

01:00.810 --> 01:03.470
Esra... you did well hanging in there.

01:07.170 --> 01:09.000
It's a beautiful baby boy.

01:10.080 --> 01:13.130
His name is... Sinbad.

01:19.070 --> 01:21.510
A child who will be king of the seven seas.

01:21.510 --> 01:24.270
Original   Otaka Shinobu<b>・</b>Otera Yoshifumi

01:25.270 --> 01:30.340
The only road left for us is to conquer this Dungeon!

01:30.340 --> 01:35.530
Possess its power, and end the war with the Reim Empire.

01:35.890 --> 01:37.990
Lay down your lives for your country,

01:38.490 --> 01:41.910
so that you may be proud soldiers of the Parthevia Empire!

01:49.350 --> 01:56.590
The first Dungeon discovered in history was located in a channel between two powerful nations.

01:56.590 --> 02:00.720
Nobody knows when these strange structures started being called Dungeons,

02:00.720 --> 02:06.160
but Parthevia and Reim battled for it ceaselessly.

02:06.160 --> 02:11.480
However, none of the 10,000 men who challenged the Dungeon returned alive.

02:12.440 --> 02:15.270
That is, until it was conquered by one young man.

02:18.040 --> 02:19.340
We’re done for!

02:19.340 --> 02:21.530
We'll never make it home alive in this storm!

02:21.750 --> 02:23.860
We're all gonna die!

02:23.860 --> 02:25.550
What are you all afraid of?

02:33.030 --> 02:36.050
The waves are heading in that direction, towards the right.

02:37.520 --> 02:38.920
We can overcome this!

02:38.920 --> 02:41.180
Director   Miyao Yoshikazu

02:55.720 --> 02:56.920
It's Contastia!

02:56.920 --> 02:58.480
What a huge town!

02:58.990 --> 03:00.990
It sure is lively here.

03:01.290 --> 03:05.490
Since it's a remote region, the government doesn't interfere much.

03:05.790 --> 03:06.850
Wanna go?

03:06.440 --> 03:08.240
It can be both good and bad at times.

03:08.720 --> 03:11.250
We should sell these goods quickly and head home.

03:15.750 --> 03:19.210
Hand over the goods if you want to live.

03:20.830 --> 03:22.220
S-Somebody!

03:22.220 --> 03:25.070
More deserters turned into thieves...

03:25.070 --> 03:28.150
It's become a normal occurrence in this town.

03:28.150 --> 03:30.220
Good grief.

03:31.730 --> 03:34.990
Boss! There’s only women and children here!

03:34.990 --> 03:37.730
Perfect! Let's take them, as well.

03:38.560 --> 03:42.190
We'll sure give ‘em lots of lovin'! What should we do with this one?

03:47.650 --> 03:48.660
Stop!

03:52.160 --> 03:55.250
Tch. It’s just a kid.

03:56.150 --> 03:59.630
Go home and take a piss!

04:01.600 --> 04:04.130
The people... the seas...

04:06.160 --> 04:08.300
They're all like waves!

04:09.800 --> 04:12.710
And there’s no wave...

04:14.830 --> 04:15.900
...that I can't handle!

04:59.270 --> 05:00.840
Thank you so much!

05:00.840 --> 05:03.150
You're super strong, Onii-chan!

05:04.470 --> 05:06.610
I just read them like waves.

05:07.950 --> 05:10.120
How can we ever repay you?

05:10.120 --> 05:11.620
I'm fine, really.

05:12.280 --> 05:15.340
More importantly, are you transporting goods without any men?

05:15.340 --> 05:16.620
Y-Yes...

05:16.800 --> 05:19.940
Our father and brother were both taken by war.

05:19.940 --> 05:22.430
The same happens in the neighboring towns.

05:22.430 --> 05:26.130
It's good they're able to escape this tragedy,

05:26.130 --> 05:28.630
but then they get cornered and end up as thieves.

05:29.730 --> 05:32.510
I see. If it's all right, why don't you hire me?

05:32.510 --> 05:33.140
Huh?

05:33.830 --> 05:37.640
I've been out of work ever since fishing was restricted.

05:37.840 --> 05:39.020
And besides...

05:41.430 --> 05:47.070
I can't allow such beautiful women to be exposed to any more danger.

05:48.640 --> 05:52.480
Ah, but we're traveling by sea on the way back, so a guard isn't really...

05:52.480 --> 05:53.830
Oh, that’s too bad.

05:54.070 --> 06:00.020
I know! How about we offer you some of our goods? They're all fresh fruit.

06:00.020 --> 06:01.080
Is that okay?

06:02.430 --> 06:06.840
Everything in here is among the most beautiful of this year's batch.

06:17.020 --> 06:20.350
P-Please don’t open the lid!

06:25.290 --> 06:28.030
My name’s Yunan. I’m a traveler.

06:28.350 --> 06:30.340
Thanks for earlier.

06:30.340 --> 06:32.530
What were you doing in a place like that?

06:32.960 --> 06:37.850
The barrel was so dark and cramped. It was really comfortable!

06:37.850 --> 06:39.040
What a weirdo.

06:39.690 --> 06:44.070
By the way, are you really okay with me staying at your place?

06:44.070 --> 06:46.840
It's only natural to help someone in need.

06:48.290 --> 06:49.920
Look! You can see it from here.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.820
This is Tison Village, my hometown.

06:57.530 --> 06:59.310
It’s Sinbad-onii-chan!

06:59.310 --> 07:01.140
Welcome home, Sinbad.

07:01.140 --> 07:03.560
Did you get a job by the harbor?

07:03.910 --> 07:07.140
There weren't any jobs, but here.

07:08.350 --> 07:09.150
Eat up.

07:09.150 --> 07:10.570
Thank you!

07:11.400 --> 07:15.360
It's rare to find fruit that fresh.

07:15.360 --> 07:18.120
We're fine. Go home and share it with your mother.

07:19.360 --> 07:20.090
It's okay.

07:20.090 --> 07:25.080
I've got my mother's portion, and also traded some in for medicinal plants.

07:25.080 --> 07:27.630
You're so reliable!

07:48.160 --> 07:50.550
People sure do trust you.

07:50.550 --> 07:51.280
You think so?

07:55.720 --> 07:56.990
Well, come on in.

07:57.880 --> 08:00.350
Wow! It's so small and dark.

08:00.350 --> 08:02.600
You've got a pretty nice place here!

08:02.600 --> 08:03.400
Y-Yeah...

08:03.400 --> 08:06.710
Oh, we have a guest? Welcome to our–

08:08.110 --> 08:11.210
It's fine, mother. You should be sleeping!

08:11.680 --> 08:12.580
But—

08:12.580 --> 08:14.720
I said it's fine! Don’t worry.

08:20.170 --> 08:25.060
I can't believe we have to come all the way out here to supervise the government split.

08:25.060 --> 08:27.190
Parthevia sure has fallen.

08:27.590 --> 08:28.860
You're right.

08:28.860 --> 08:32.650
The captain isn't the type of person to come to a place like this, though.

08:35.030 --> 08:37.140
Enough chit-chat.

08:37.140 --> 08:39.030
If you value your lives, that is.

08:39.370 --> 08:40.270
Y-Yes, sir!

08:40.270 --> 08:41.540
Pardon our insolence!

08:41.960 --> 08:46.080
Geez... our captain's so different from him.

08:46.080 --> 08:46.790
But you know,

08:47.600 --> 08:52.000
that's what makes Dragul our platoon leader.

09:04.150 --> 09:05.660
Mornin'... .

09:05.660 --> 09:07.920
It's a nice bright day, isn't it Sinbad?

09:07.920 --> 09:09.020
Morning, Yunan.

09:11.130 --> 09:13.230
You're early. Heading out already?

09:13.230 --> 09:17.240
Yup. After all, I have a job lifting supplies at the harbor.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.490
Here. Have some if you like.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.500
Thank you!

09:26.030 --> 09:27.340
Ow, that's hot...

09:28.800 --> 09:29.750
This is good!

09:29.750 --> 09:31.000
What are you gonna do from here?

09:31.610 --> 09:35.060
I'll have a look around the village and then start traveling again.

09:37.530 --> 09:38.380
I see.

09:39.040 --> 09:42.660
You're welcome here anytime you want. See you around.

09:46.480 --> 09:48.450
Does it suit your taste?

09:49.970 --> 09:51.630
Oh, good morning.

09:51.630 --> 09:54.540
Thank you for your hospitality. I'm in your debt.

09:54.540 --> 09:56.280
Not at all.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.780
Thank you.

10:04.120 --> 10:08.390
This isn't right. I'm making my guest worry about me.

10:08.390 --> 10:10.290
Have you been sick for long?

10:10.570 --> 10:14.670
Yes... I've been nothing but trouble for that child.

10:15.790 --> 10:20.550
He's such a gentle boy. Just like his father.

10:21.110 --> 10:27.060
He used to say, “Sinbad has a special kind of strength.”

10:32.050 --> 10:33.060
Daddy...

10:33.990 --> 10:35.570
Not that way.

10:36.270 --> 10:37.340
It's that way.

10:46.200 --> 10:51.080
But it's my fault that he's stuck in this village.

10:51.430 --> 10:55.090
That's my greatest concern.

10:55.370 --> 10:58.340
Oh dear, I'm sorry I had you listen to my weird rambling...

10:59.110 --> 11:04.150
I don't know why, but I feel that I can talk to you about anything.

11:04.150 --> 11:05.100
Really?

11:05.570 --> 11:09.620
That's why, Yunan-san... I have a favor to ask of you.

11:09.620 --> 11:16.300
If I die, please guide that child in the way he should go.

11:20.110 --> 11:22.480
Because, you know...

11:22.480 --> 11:25.120
A traveler like yourself has way more life experience than I do.

11:25.520 --> 11:28.890
He'll think it's weird coming from his mother.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.620
If that's what you want,

11:32.070 --> 11:33.330
it would be my pleasure.

11:35.750 --> 11:37.310
It’s terrible!

11:41.390 --> 11:43.010
It’s terrible, Esra-san!

11:43.480 --> 11:45.030
Sinbad’s been...

11:51.990 --> 11:56.270
I am Dragul, Lieutenant of the western boundary platoon.

11:56.790 --> 12:00.780
You should have received our repeated enlistment notices by now.

12:01.130 --> 12:03.780
You are to report within three days.

12:03.780 --> 12:05.530
And if I refuse?

12:09.870 --> 12:14.040
The choice is not yours to make. This is an order from the army.

12:14.520 --> 12:16.580
Why are they treating him so badly?

12:16.580 --> 12:20.750
Sin's been ignoring the army's letters. But they finally...

12:21.040 --> 12:22.880
What are you doing to Sin-san?!

12:22.880 --> 12:24.290
Shut up!

12:27.470 --> 12:28.790
Don’t be so hasty.

12:28.790 --> 12:35.100
You'll also be able to serve your country as manpower in about five years.

12:37.390 --> 12:40.270
Hey... hang on...

12:41.270 --> 12:43.100
Manpower?

12:43.100 --> 12:46.280
Just what are we to you?

12:47.000 --> 12:48.800
Just like I said.

12:48.800 --> 12:51.290
Citizens are supposed to work for their country.

12:52.200 --> 12:57.790
You're all indispensable manpower for the war against the Reim Empire.

12:58.800 --> 13:01.550
We're not your tools for war.

13:02.450 --> 13:05.630
My father joined the troops and never returned...

13:05.630 --> 13:08.550
The same thing happened to every man here.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.560
I'll never join your army!

13:13.670 --> 13:16.560
That's right! It's just like he said!

13:17.280 --> 13:19.420
You just want us to suffer, don't you?!

13:19.420 --> 13:20.580
Quit messing with us!

13:20.580 --> 13:22.070
What's with these people...

13:23.050 --> 13:24.570
Lieutenant Dragul...

13:27.950 --> 13:31.780
Sinbad... I heard you have a mother, don't you?

13:33.030 --> 13:35.600
Refusing to join the army is a statutory crime.

13:35.600 --> 13:39.140
Don't forget that your unwillingness to comply will also affect her.

13:40.010 --> 13:43.680
You're all aware of the matter with the Dungeon, right?

13:43.680 --> 13:49.050
Our country's magicians say that there is great power in there.

13:49.320 --> 13:55.180
And we must obtain this power at all costs.

13:55.180 --> 13:57.580
That is the imperial command of our Highness.

13:57.580 --> 14:01.520
It's not only for your country, but for the citizens as well.

14:01.520 --> 14:03.160
Sinbad.

14:03.160 --> 14:08.530
In the end, your father joined the army for the sake of the country.

14:08.530 --> 14:10.380
Prepare yourself.

14:11.710 --> 14:13.340
Nii-chan!

14:15.540 --> 14:17.540
You can’t go!

14:17.540 --> 14:19.920
You'll die!

14:25.890 --> 14:30.930
Right now, enlisting in the army means going into the Dungeon.

14:31.750 --> 14:36.060
More than 10,000 people challenged it, but none returned.

14:36.060 --> 14:38.430
It's truly a place of death.

14:40.250 --> 14:42.940
I can't die just yet.

14:43.710 --> 14:47.190
For the sake of my mother and everyone in the village.

14:48.040 --> 14:50.840
You can't escape enlistment?

14:50.840 --> 14:52.550
You saw what happened earlier, didn't you?

14:52.550 --> 14:56.590
If I refuse, it's the gallows. This is basically slave labor.

14:56.590 --> 14:58.700
There's no way I can defy them.

14:59.420 --> 15:00.990
If I enlist, I'll die.

15:00.990 --> 15:02.860
And if I refuse, I'll also die.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.710
The war won't end either.

15:05.330 --> 15:09.040
This country is doomed.

15:09.040 --> 15:12.590
Then, you should go to that tower.

15:13.480 --> 15:17.200
Like I said, none of the 10,000 who went made it ba—

15:17.200 --> 15:20.680
You just said, this country is doomed.

15:20.680 --> 15:23.400
In that case, become a king.

15:24.670 --> 15:28.170
Change this country – no, this world – with your own hands.

15:28.950 --> 15:30.400
You're joking, right?

15:30.970 --> 15:34.540
“The people and the seas are all like waves.

15:34.540 --> 15:37.150
And there's no wave that I can't handle.”

15:38.840 --> 15:39.910
Right?

15:40.680 --> 15:45.380
Accept your destiny. You'll know how to overcome this.

15:46.950 --> 15:49.540
Go on. Head for the tower.

15:49.540 --> 15:53.180
It has the hope that you want – the power of a king.

15:54.130 --> 15:55.930
The power of a king...

15:57.730 --> 15:58.430
Yunan!

15:59.600 --> 16:01.430
Who exactly are you?

16:03.910 --> 16:05.440
Me?

16:05.960 --> 16:08.290
I'm just a wandering traveler.

16:11.840 --> 16:18.950
If... that power really exists... I'll make it mine.

16:20.150 --> 16:24.300
If I can change this world, I'll do it.

16:32.130 --> 16:33.970
Mother, I...

16:36.030 --> 16:37.850
W-Well...

16:39.570 --> 16:42.240
No, it's nothing.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.640
Sinbad.

16:45.030 --> 16:46.650
Come here.

16:55.960 --> 17:00.410
The hundred men assigned to conquer the Dungeon are ready for deployment.

17:01.570 --> 17:04.160
His Majesty has high expectations of you.

17:04.530 --> 17:08.030
Complete this mission magnificently and return here.

17:08.030 --> 17:09.360
With pleasure.

17:09.360 --> 17:12.990
The first elite squadron with a thousand men was completely obliterated.

17:12.990 --> 17:15.890
And now he wants me to send another hundred civilians.

17:16.880 --> 17:20.510
In other words, if there is a sacrifice from the famous Dragul family

17:20.510 --> 17:23.180
the masses will be more easily calmed.

17:24.730 --> 17:26.940
Although it's a noble family, I'm still the youngest.

17:28.160 --> 17:33.000
If it were my brothers, they would never have been given such a mission.

17:33.000 --> 17:37.450
Don't say such things lightly inside the royal palace, Dragul.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.040
Serendine-sama!

17:39.040 --> 17:40.640
It's been a while.

17:40.640 --> 17:41.700
That name's too long.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.450
Just Seren will do.

17:44.730 --> 17:46.150
N-No...

17:46.890 --> 17:49.960
You're always so stiff, even at a time like this...

17:50.510 --> 17:55.900
Even when we were children, you were the cute little brother that would follow me around like a duckling.

17:58.840 --> 17:59.590
Oh well.

18:01.330 --> 18:06.600
Is it true that you're leading the Dungeon conquest this time?

18:06.930 --> 18:07.670
Yes!

18:09.280 --> 18:10.350
I see.

18:12.230 --> 18:13.740
Serendine-sama,

18:13.740 --> 18:19.360
since we were young, you've always treated me as if I was family.

18:20.270 --> 18:23.490
I promise that this conquest for the Dungeon will be a success.

18:23.960 --> 18:27.860
I absolutely will not tarnish Serendine-sama's name.

18:36.360 --> 18:37.940
Have you done a roll call?

18:37.940 --> 18:41.670
Yes, sir. But there was one that didn't turn up.

18:41.670 --> 18:44.300
Sinbad from the Tison Village isn't here.

18:44.300 --> 18:45.390
Sinbad?

18:47.010 --> 18:49.110
That guy, huh? That's fine.

18:49.110 --> 18:52.460
Missing a brat or two won't make a difference.

18:52.460 --> 18:54.950
A brat? You're a brat as well, aren't you?

18:54.950 --> 18:55.860
You!

18:56.250 --> 19:00.220
Listen up! The power of this Dungeon belongs to me!

19:00.220 --> 19:02.360
There's no way I'll let you take it!

19:02.850 --> 19:06.310
For someone like you who has only made the people of this land suffer...

19:06.310 --> 19:07.870
Never, you hear me?!

19:10.640 --> 19:12.120
Yunan!

19:12.120 --> 19:14.910
It's right there, Sinbad.

19:14.910 --> 19:17.750
This is the entrance to the Dungeon.

19:18.390 --> 19:23.990
Once you go all the way up, you can't come out until you've conquered the Dungeon.

19:23.990 --> 19:25.500
Are you ready?

19:25.500 --> 19:26.260
Yeah. I'm ready.

19:26.590 --> 19:31.020
I've already decided that I'll surely get that power and come back.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.400
Definitely...

19:34.670 --> 19:37.400
Sinbad... Come here.

19:41.070 --> 19:43.180
Please take this with you.

19:43.180 --> 19:46.440
That's... father's memento.

19:46.440 --> 19:50.580
Sin... please stop holding yourself back on my account.

19:51.970 --> 19:55.170
I've always relied on you for help.

19:56.130 --> 19:58.630
But you've found it, haven't you?

19:59.090 --> 20:01.150
Something that only you can do.

20:02.280 --> 20:05.040
Go and do what you have to do.

20:05.040 --> 20:07.380
That's what your father would have wanted, as well.

20:08.550 --> 20:13.420
I'll be fine. There are people around to help me.

20:13.420 --> 20:15.900
So... be on your way.

20:29.080 --> 20:31.290
Mother... Thank you.

20:32.890 --> 20:35.330
Yunan! Let's meet again!

20:38.330 --> 20:44.310
Sinbad... you truly are the miracle child that will change the world.

20:44.310 --> 20:47.600
If someone like you obtains the Dungeon's power, then...

20:47.600 --> 20:50.340
Who will you become?

20:50.340 --> 20:54.850
I'm excited, yet anxious.

20:55.310 --> 20:58.350
Now... go forth, Sinbad!

20:59.040 --> 21:01.510
Reinforcements! Advance!

21:08.610 --> 21:11.870
This is... Light?

21:15.370 --> 21:17.750
What... is that?

21:18.510 --> 21:20.590
It feels like I can reach it if I extend my hand...

21:27.520 --> 21:28.760
This place...

21:44.280 --> 21:45.420
This is...

21:46.450 --> 21:47.550
The dungeon!

21:52.030 --> 21:57.290
「Part 1 <b>・</b> The Conquest of Dungeon Baal<b>」</b>
